; Smaragd Dash demo cave 3: keys and machines (tools/democave.py plays it, with
; 3-keys-and-machines.moves; tools/record-tour.sh films it).
;
; The upper path, left to right: three keys and their doors; the diamond key,
; which turns the trapped emeralds behind it into emeralds. A case with
; boulders and an emerald on a conveyor belt, which its switch below starts
; and the direction switch turns. An expanding wall follows Rockford through a
; corridor; the expanding wall switch turns the walls from growing sideways
; to growing up and down: the expanding steel wall above the path follows him
; down a shaft, an expanding wall that grows every way along the corridor
; below. A teleporter takes him down to the lower path.
; The lower path, right to left: the pneumatic hammer, and with it a walled
; emerald and a walled key below the path freed; two skeletons, enough to
; stir the pot; that makes the gravity switch (behind the key's door) work: gravity turns upwards, and a boulder
; rises onto the voodoo, which leaves steel walls and a time penalty that
; turns into a gravestone. Out through the hidden outbox.
